  "cues": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 11.18,
      "text": "In the councils of government, we must guard against the acquisition of unwarranted influence,",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.199933,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.141113
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "start": 11.18,
      "end": 15.7,
      "text": "whether sought or unsought, by the military industrial complex.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.199933,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.141113
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "start": 15.7,
      "end": 21.7,
      "text": "Today, President Dwight Eisenhower's famous warning during his farewell address in 1961",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.199933,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.141113
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "start": 21.7,
      "end": 23.82,
      "text": "seems prophetic.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.199933,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.141113
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "start": 23.82,
      "end": 28.5,
      "text": "Look at the defense budget since World War II in today's dollars, and the trend in U.S.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.199933,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.141113
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "start": 28.5,
      "end": 31.86,
      "text": "government spending on the military is clear.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.199933,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.141113
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "start": 31.86,
      "end": 36.5,
      "text": "And yet it's surprising given how reluctant Americans have been historically to go to",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.171712,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.006096
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "start": 36.5,
      "end": 37.5,
      "text": "war.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.171712,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.006096
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "start": 37.5,
      "end": 44.1,
      "text": "After World War II ended, Harry Truman wanted to wind down military spending, but then fighting",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.171712,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.006096
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "start": 44.1,
      "end": 49.38,
      "text": "broke out in Korea, a proxy conflict in the Cold War.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.171712,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.006096
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "start": 49.38,
      "end": 54.66,
      "text": "Truman's advisors urged him to increase military spending and armaments.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.171712,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.006096
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "start": 54.66,
      "end": 57.14,
      "text": "That meant building the hydrogen bomb.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.171712,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.006096
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "start": 57.14,
      "end": 63.54,
      "text": "The H bomb was detonated at Anuetok.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.171712,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.006096
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "start": 63.54,
      "end": 67.66,
      "text": "This measures increased annual military spending dramatically.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.146911,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.003483
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "start": 67.66,
      "end": 75.3,
      "text": "In 1952, it reached nearly $455 billion in today's dollars.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.146911,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.003483
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "start": 75.3,
      "end": 79.32,
      "text": "Spending kept growing when American troops were sent to Vietnam.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.146911,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.003483
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "start": 79.32,
      "end": 84.1,
      "text": "One of the big drivers in spending throughout the Cold War, technology.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.146911,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.003483
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "start": 84.1,
      "end": 89.34,
      "text": "The United States Army, as almost everyone knows, is placing an ever-increasing emphasis",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.146911,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.003483
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "start": 89.34,
      "end": 91.94,
      "text": "on guided missiles.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.146911,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.003483
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "start": 91.94,
      "end": 96.66,
      "text": "And in military technology peaked under President Reagan, who thought of spending itself as",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.150298,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.054962
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "start": 96.66,
      "end": 97.94,
      "text": "a weapon.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.150298,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.054962
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "start": 97.94,
      "end": 98.94,
      "text": "The idea?",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.150298,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.054962
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "start": 98.94,
      "end": 104.82,
      "text": "Bankrupt the Soviet Union with massive programs like the Strategic Defense Initiative, better",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.150298,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.054962
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "start": 104.82,
      "end": 106.66,
      "text": "known as Star Wars.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.150298,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.054962
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "start": 106.66,
      "end": 111.62,
      "text": "At one point, the Defense Department estimated that a rudimentary missile defense system",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.150298,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.054962
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "start": 111.62,
      "end": 116.94,
      "text": "of this kind would cost $115 billion.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.150298,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.054962
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "start": 116.94,
      "end": 125.46,
      "text": "As a result, annual military spending reached a new high in 1985 at $559 billion in today's",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.187994,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.072571
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "start": 125.46,
      "end": 126.46,
      "text": "dollars.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.187994,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.072571
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "start": 126.46,
      "end": 133.54,
      "text": "George W. Bush was elected, promising a humbler foreign policy, but shortly after he took office",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.187994,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.072571
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "start": 133.54,
      "end": 136.06,
      "text": "came the attacks of 9-11.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.187994,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.072571
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "start": 136.06,
      "end": 141.58,
      "text": "The Bush administration submitted a baseline defense budget, along with a second budget,",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.187994,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.072571
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "start": 141.58,
      "end": 150.54,
      "text": "to account for the ballooning costs, which reached a combined $747 billion in 2010.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.161486,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.646973
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "start": 150.54,
      "end": 155.7,
      "text": "Now even with the country wary of war and the growing debt, Congress has increased military",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.161486,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.646973
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "start": 155.7,
      "end": 157.06,
      "text": "spending yet again.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.161486,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.646973
    }
  ],
  "created_at": "2026-11-05T02:08:59+0800"
}